--- !u!114 &1073286291
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1073286290}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8777c1a0e0ab4954e89d35f5ca94808a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _Text: 'This sample expands upon the <b>Brains</b> sample to allow a character
    hold various weapons which each have their own set of animations.


    It only
    uses this system for Attack, Equip, and UnEquip animations, but the concept could
    be extended to other animations such as having a different Idle or Walk animation
    to hold the weapon correctly.


    The online documentation shows what this
    could look like with some proper weapon animations, but unfortunately they can''t
    be included in Animancer due to licensing restrictions so this scene just reuses
    the animations and props from earlier samples.'
--- !u!4 &1073286292
